    "text": "8 hours ago In late September, construction began on the Wygal Hall replacement building, a nearly $100 million project set for completion in 2028. The appearance of construction barriers and machinery around the build site, along with the demolition of Bristow Hall, marked the beginning of a new era for music at Longwood University. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
